    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ba2a2e25be2d4d2aa955960d0a75aa9a",
      "statement": "save_to_db_node persists the generated course by updating the existing Course row's status to 'generated' and summary, then for each ModuleGenerated creates a Module row and resolves neuro_principle_code/krauu_competence_codes/bloom_level_codes (LLM-supplied catalog codes, not IDs) against the NeuroPrinciple/KrauuCompetence/BloomLevel tables filtered by is_active, silently dropping unresolved codes (with a fallback to neuro principle code 'NP-01') and logging warnings when nothing resolves.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/agents/course_generator/nodes/save_to_db.py#L29-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:157131746d3ba195a222e4294a4bff4e6cce543b8408d3888642d2d1dce6bfcf:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f57440d1e26c4cd3b81acba68bbe2e95",
      "statement": "save_to_db_node enforces at most one learn_blocks entry per generated module, raising ValueError (aborting the whole save) if a module has more than one, and persists practice questions directly under the module with repair logic: closed questions missing correct_answer fall back to the first closed_option or are skipped if none exist, and open questions missing example_answer get a fixed fallback string.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/agents/course_generator/nodes/save_to_db.py#L118-L169",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cb87c6c327457bc668a16be93629aef3ca20b50801760f49bfbf0d6ea017de14:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_84257c7e364a4c85b46fdd67109213a0",
      "statement": "save_to_db_node performs a single db.commit() at the end covering the course status update and all created modules/learn blocks/practice questions/options/keywords, so a mid-loop exception leaves the transaction uncommitted for the router's rollback-and-mark-failed handling to clean up.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/agents/course_generator/nodes/save_to_db.py#L171-L176",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:db86445bf895f0f50d1b092cb89621ad1397196f4773fe1a67a282828158d7c5:"
        }
